  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3e4b5683c1ea36345958694d590b6436, type: 3}
  m_Name: COC3_Quiz_Final_Review_Q06
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuizQuestionData
  questionText: A printer is shared but not listed in the directory. What is the
    consequence?
  choices:
  - Nobody can print to it at all
  - Only administrators can use it
  - Clients cannot find it by name - every client becomes a manual setup
  - The printer will not accept a test page
  correctChoiceIndex: 2
  points: 10
  explanation: Sharing puts it on the network. Publishing it to the domain is what
    lets a client search for it by name instead of being told its address and driver.
